msgid "`math <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#math>`_"
msgstr "`math <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#math>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:90
msgid "math.remainder() added to implement IEEE 754-style remainder"
msgstr ""
"math.remainder() toegevoegd om de rest volgens de IEEE 754-stijl te "
"implementeren"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:92
msgid "`re <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#re>`_"
msgstr "`re <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#re>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:94
msgid ""
"A number of tidy up features including better support for splitting on empty"
" strings and copy support for compiled expressions and match objects"
msgstr ""
"Een aantal opschoonfuncties, waaronder betere ondersteuning voor het "
"splitsen op lege tekenreeksen en kopieerondersteuning voor gecompileerde "
"expressies en match-objecten"

